1
00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:52,500
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:54,020
(This story is entirely fictional.)

3
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:55,900
(All settings are imaginary.)

4
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:58,900
=Episode 16=

5
00:01:03,360 --> 00:01:04,960
Why hasn't Boss come out yet?

6
00:01:04,960 --> 00:01:07,200
What's that psycho Natuo
freaking out about now?

7
00:01:13,360 --> 00:01:13,760
Boss.

8
00:01:13,990 --> 00:01:15,000
You're finally back.

9
00:01:18,550 --> 00:01:19,240
Zhou Yan.

10
00:01:19,430 --> 00:01:20,030
Daya.

11
00:01:23,450 --> 00:01:24,080
Zhou Yan.

12
00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:27,640
I'm glad you're okay.

13
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:29,960
This time,

14
00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:33,000
we really have to say goodbye.

15
00:01:36,280 --> 00:01:36,760
Daya.

16
00:01:37,640 --> 00:01:38,040
Daya!

17
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:39,160
Daya!

18
00:01:39,160 --> 00:01:40,000
What did you do to her?

19
00:01:40,360 --> 00:01:41,720
What did you do to her?

20
00:01:41,720 --> 00:01:42,480
They put a poison capsule

21
00:01:43,320 --> 00:01:45,010
inside her down there.

22
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:47,560
It'll only stay intact for five days.

23
00:01:48,320 --> 00:01:49,220
Once it breaks,

24
00:01:50,720 --> 00:01:51,530
she'll be dead for sure.

25
00:01:55,430 --> 00:01:56,120
Where's the antidote?

26
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:58,060
Talk!

27
00:01:58,060 --> 00:01:58,960
I'm just a hired hand.

28
00:01:58,960 --> 00:01:59,480
I don't know.

29
00:01:59,760 --> 00:02:00,500
I really don't know.

30
00:02:01,010 --> 00:02:01,500
I don't know.

31
00:02:02,410 --> 00:02:04,040
Where's the antidote?

32
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:05,200
I really don't know.

33
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:05,770
I swear.

34
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:07,320
I'm just a hired hand.

35
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:08,320
- I don't know anything!
- Zhou Yan!

36
00:02:08,320 --> 00:02:09,330
Zhou Yan, calm down.

37
00:02:09,330 --> 00:02:10,620
How can I calm down?

38
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:12,270
They killed Sihan with poison.

39
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:13,820
Now they've done this to Daya.

40
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:16,100
You all deserve to die!

41
00:02:16,480 --> 00:02:17,680
I don't care how you do it.

42
00:02:17,910 --> 00:02:19,200
Operate on her. Save her now!

43
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:20,510
Sure. I'll do it!

44
00:02:20,750 --> 00:02:21,160
I will!

45
00:02:35,290 --> 00:02:35,810
Doctor.

46
00:02:36,690 --> 00:02:37,500
How is she?

47
00:02:38,530 --> 00:02:39,480
Her life is no longer in danger.

48
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:40,870
But...

49
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:42,560
The toxins have reached her organs.

50
00:02:44,040 --> 00:02:44,560
From now on,

51
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:45,830
she won't be able to get pregnant.

52
00:02:54,060 --> 00:02:54,820
She's alive. That's enough.

53
00:02:55,330 --> 00:02:56,280
She's alive. That's enough.

54
00:02:56,810 --> 00:02:57,640
She's alive. That's enough.

55
00:03:23,890 --> 00:03:24,550
You're awake.

56
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:26,120
I made you fish noodle soup.

57
00:03:26,370 --> 00:03:27,160
Come have some.

58
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:28,960
Let's see who's the better cook.

59
00:03:31,550 --> 00:03:33,000
Why did you save me?

60
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:35,920
What am I supposed to be now?

61
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:38,260
I'm not even...

62
00:03:39,390 --> 00:03:41,300
I don't even feel like a whole woman.

63
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:42,860
How am I supposed to live?

64
00:03:47,440 --> 00:03:48,600
But in this world,

65
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:51,360
nothing matters more than being alive.

66
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:53,440
Don't think that way.

67
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,240
Life goes on, either way.

68
00:03:57,420 --> 00:03:59,080
You think you've got a chance now

69
00:03:59,640 --> 00:04:00,560
just because I'm like this?

70
00:04:06,920 --> 00:04:07,920
Why would I think that?

71
00:04:09,200 --> 00:04:11,000
I've been called a loser
since I was a kid.

72
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:13,200
No woman ever cared about me.

73
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:16,200
I fell for you

74
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:18,080
after you saved me that day.

75
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:24,080
Ma Ding.

76
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:26,560
Saving you was an accident, you know.

77
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:30,020
I was there to save Zhou Yan, not you.

78
00:04:30,520 --> 00:04:32,530
You just happened to be there.

79
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:35,240
It was all part of Suowen's plan.

80
00:04:35,530 --> 00:04:35,830
I...

81
00:04:37,640 --> 00:04:39,480
I never liked you.

82
00:04:39,660 --> 00:04:41,960
Falling for someone
is always an accident.

83
00:04:43,400 --> 00:04:44,440
I don't care what you think.

84
00:04:45,020 --> 00:04:46,080
But to me,

85
00:04:46,080 --> 00:04:48,090
you're the most beautiful woman
in the world.

86
00:04:49,050 --> 00:04:50,520
I just like you.

87
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:01,200
There's fish soup cooking.

88
00:05:01,810 --> 00:05:02,890
I'll get you another bowl.

89
00:05:41,320 --> 00:05:42,600
These ledgers are from
Dashan's fight club

90
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:44,280
and Suowen's hospital.

91
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:45,960
Thirty percent of their funds

92
00:05:45,960 --> 00:05:47,120
go to the same anonymous account
every month.

93
00:05:47,430 --> 00:05:48,520
Track this account.

94
00:05:49,290 --> 00:05:49,690
Got it.

95
00:05:57,500 --> 00:05:58,400
Recently,

96
00:05:58,400 --> 00:06:01,880
Langia police shut down
Dashan's underground fight club

97
00:06:01,990 --> 00:06:03,520
and Suowen's underground hospital.

98
00:06:04,200 --> 00:06:05,750
The long-running cases involving

99
00:06:05,750 --> 00:06:06,840
human trafficking,

100
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:08,210
organ trafficking,

101
00:06:08,210 --> 00:06:09,400
and drug smuggling

102
00:06:09,770 --> 00:06:10,830
have been solved.

103
00:06:11,580 --> 00:06:13,240
All those involved

104
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,640
will face the full force of the law.

105
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:15,880
I, Mokun,

106
00:06:15,880 --> 00:06:18,760
will bring a new dawn to Langia.

107
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:20,240
Chief,

108
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:21,720
I've heard these cases

109
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:23,520
involve high-ranking officials
in Langia.

110
00:06:23,770 --> 00:06:25,120
Can you release their names?

111
00:06:26,060 --> 00:06:27,270
We're still investigating those involved

112
00:06:27,350 --> 00:06:29,640
and gathering evidence.

113
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:31,820
Please trust the police.

114
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:35,610
We'll root out every criminal force
in Langia.

115
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:36,840
That's all for today.

116
00:06:37,860 --> 00:06:40,040
Chief...

117
00:06:40,430 --> 00:06:40,920
Dad.

118
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:44,680
Mona.

119
00:06:45,080 --> 00:06:47,280
Dashan and Suowen's cases are closed.

120
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:49,320
This is...

121
00:06:50,440 --> 00:06:51,520
What day is it today?

122
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:52,920
You haven't forgotten, have you?

123
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:56,200
How could I forget?

124
00:06:56,840 --> 00:06:58,290
October 13th.

125
00:06:59,130 --> 00:07:00,810
It's your mom's death anniversary.

126
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:14,200
Mom.

127
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:17,320
We finally made progress
on tracking down Mian.

128
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:19,820
May your spirit watch over me.

129
00:07:20,520 --> 00:07:21,560
Help me catch Mian soon.

130
00:07:21,970 --> 00:07:22,960
Mona.

131
00:07:23,810 --> 00:07:24,710
Actually,

132
00:07:24,710 --> 00:07:26,310
as your parents,

133
00:07:26,560 --> 00:07:27,640
all we want

134
00:07:27,640 --> 00:07:28,760
is for you to be safe

135
00:07:28,760 --> 00:07:29,610
and happy.

136
00:07:29,610 --> 00:07:30,320
That's all we ask.

137
00:07:30,970 --> 00:07:32,120
That's what you want.

138
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:35,370
If you'd been here
when it happened,

139
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:36,960
my mom wouldn't have died.

140
00:07:36,960 --> 00:07:37,800
Okay, okay.

141
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:41,290
Let's not talk about the past.

142
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:53,440
Let me introduce you.

143
00:07:53,760 --> 00:07:54,240
Zhou Yan.

144
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:55,480
The new Mian.

145
00:07:55,990 --> 00:07:56,410
Hello.

146
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:57,360
Chief Mokun.

147
00:08:12,080 --> 00:08:12,880
This time,

148
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:14,200
thanks to you,

149
00:08:14,520 --> 00:08:15,940
the Suowen case

150
00:08:16,200 --> 00:08:17,870
went so smoothly.

151
00:08:18,500 --> 00:08:19,140
You're too kind.

152
00:08:19,540 --> 00:08:20,640
Your speech

153
00:08:20,640 --> 00:08:21,530
was truly inspiring.

154
00:08:21,820 --> 00:08:23,560
Our goals now align with the police.

155
00:08:24,320 --> 00:08:24,810
Dad.

156
00:08:25,320 --> 00:08:26,600
Since he's the new Mian,

157
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:29,440
he must have more leads
on the old Mian.

158
00:08:29,770 --> 00:08:31,040
We should work closely with him.

159
00:08:31,880 --> 00:08:32,600
Really?

160
00:08:32,810 --> 00:08:34,050
But in my view,

161
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,640
Langia's future

162
00:08:36,020 --> 00:08:37,390
no longer needs

163
00:08:37,880 --> 00:08:38,560
Mian.

164
00:08:38,750 --> 00:08:39,310
Dad.

165
00:08:39,800 --> 00:08:40,800
Sorry.

166
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,560
I still have a lot

167
00:08:42,880 --> 00:08:43,760
to do.

168
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:45,010
I...

169
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:45,960
I'll be going.

170
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:55,000
Sorry about that.

171
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:56,360
My dad's

172
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:57,780
just a little too cautious.

173
00:08:58,210 --> 00:08:58,720
It's okay.

174
00:08:59,800 --> 00:09:00,880
I think we'll meet again.

175
00:09:02,190 --> 00:09:03,520
Suowen is dead.

176
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:06,080
But Langia's drug trade hasn't slowed.

177
00:09:06,880 --> 00:09:08,640
Natuo must be behind this.

178
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:12,520
I'll trace the drug supply chain.

179
00:09:13,310 --> 00:09:14,520
I'll take him down for sure,

180
00:09:15,160 --> 00:09:16,480
and Mian behind him too.

181
00:09:16,890 --> 00:09:17,200
Okay.

182
00:09:18,640 --> 00:09:19,500
Natuo.

183
00:09:21,340 --> 00:09:22,760
It's time to deal with him.

184
00:09:29,680 --> 00:09:30,550
Hey.

185
00:09:30,550 --> 00:09:31,440
General.

186
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:34,480
Happy with the last shipment?

187
00:09:36,040 --> 00:09:37,480
The police have been cracking down.

188
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:39,000
But don't worry.

189
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,960
I've cleaned up all the trash.

190
00:09:41,820 --> 00:09:42,950
Our business

191
00:09:42,950 --> 00:09:44,520
will continue as usual.

192
00:09:50,020 --> 00:09:51,600
They're blasting at the mine.

193
00:09:52,160 --> 00:09:53,160
Here's to

194
00:09:53,560 --> 00:09:54,680
our business booming.

195
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:00,520
What are you waiting for?

196
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:02,560
Clean up the trash.

197
00:10:21,040 --> 00:10:23,320
Someone from my hometown
escaped from the mine yesterday.

198
00:10:24,140 --> 00:10:26,720
He said Natuo killed the enslaved miners
who hid drugs in the jade.

199
00:10:26,720 --> 00:10:27,420
All of them.

200
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:29,340
Then he burned them to ashes.

201
00:10:35,240 --> 00:10:35,720
Boss.

202
00:10:36,140 --> 00:10:36,690
Look.

203
00:10:38,600 --> 00:10:39,910
That was brutal.

204
00:10:40,150 --> 00:10:40,980
He destroyed the evidence,

205
00:10:40,980 --> 00:10:42,040
leaving no witnesses.

206
00:10:43,470 --> 00:10:46,210
The drug supply chain has shifted.

207
00:10:46,470 --> 00:10:47,580
We've lost the lead.

208
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:49,640
He's completely ruthless.

209
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:52,600
The workers at the mine must be furious,
but too scared to speak.

210
00:10:53,520 --> 00:10:54,760
He brought this on himself.

211
00:10:55,400 --> 00:10:57,880
We'll bury him in the grave
he dug with his own hands.

212
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:12,360
Greetings.

213
00:11:12,630 --> 00:11:13,120
Greetings.

214
00:11:15,140 --> 00:11:16,240
My dear uncles.

215
00:11:16,760 --> 00:11:17,520
Long time no see.

216
00:11:18,040 --> 00:11:18,590
Layla.

217
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:22,360
Why did you call
the whole family here today?

218
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:23,440
What's going on?

219
00:11:27,640 --> 00:11:30,160
Songcai personally issued this
appointment letter.

220
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:33,880
From now on, the group's mines

221
00:11:35,050 --> 00:11:36,920
will be under my management.

222
00:11:47,520 --> 00:11:48,920
This does have

223
00:11:49,760 --> 00:11:50,980
the family head's signature.

224
00:11:51,520 --> 00:11:55,040
But Natuo has always run the mines.

225
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:57,400
Why would the family head

226
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:59,120
suddenly change his mind?

227
00:12:01,190 --> 00:12:02,770
Natuo crossed Mian.

228
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:03,920
Besides,

229
00:12:04,240 --> 00:12:07,170
he secretly traded drugs
with Suowen behind our backs.

230
00:12:07,920 --> 00:12:09,040
The police are onto him.

231
00:12:09,720 --> 00:12:12,120
If we let him keep running wild,

232
00:12:12,410 --> 00:12:13,160
our group

233
00:12:13,800 --> 00:12:14,840
will be finished.

234
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:15,880
But...

235
00:12:16,920 --> 00:12:17,800
Does Mr. Natuo

236
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:19,040
know about this?

237
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:21,960
Natuo is the family heir.

238
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:25,540
He's become more powerful
over the years.

239
00:12:26,030 --> 00:12:28,610
If we ask him to give up the mines now,

240
00:12:29,400 --> 00:12:30,240
he probably

241
00:12:31,040 --> 00:12:31,880
won't agree.

242
00:12:35,030 --> 00:12:36,360
The group called a board meeting

243
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:37,690
without telling me.

244
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:38,840
What's this about?

245
00:12:41,590 --> 00:12:42,260
Everyone,

246
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:45,200
Natuo's in serious trouble now.

247
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:48,240
Are you still taking his side?

248
00:12:49,220 --> 00:12:50,560
He crossed Mian, after all.

249
00:12:51,620 --> 00:12:54,160
Just look at what happened
to Dashan and Suowen.

250
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:57,360
And I came here today

251
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:00,600
to solve this problem for everyone.

252
00:13:01,560 --> 00:13:02,160
Oh, perfect timing.

253
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:05,560
Let's welcome my new partner.

254
00:13:37,560 --> 00:13:38,930
♪Dust rises along the border♪

255
00:13:38,930 --> 00:13:40,210
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

256
00:13:40,210 --> 00:13:41,560
♪Spent shells fall, last echoes ring♪

257
00:13:41,560 --> 00:13:42,860
♪Brothers yesterday, foes today♪

258
00:13:42,860 --> 00:13:44,190
♪Fate's blade falls, who can stop it?♪

259
00:13:44,190 --> 00:13:45,480
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

260
00:13:45,480 --> 00:13:46,890
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

261
00:13:46,890 --> 00:13:48,530
♪My life is mine to bear♪

262
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:51,170
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

263
00:13:51,170 --> 00:13:53,900
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

264
00:13:53,900 --> 00:13:56,130
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

265
00:13:56,130 --> 00:13:57,570
♪My fate is mine to command♪

266
00:13:57,570 --> 00:13:58,800
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

267
00:13:58,800 --> 00:14:00,210
♪I weave through storms of bullets♪

268
00:14:00,210 --> 00:14:01,500
♪I fight through flashing blades♪

269
00:14:01,500 --> 00:14:02,910
♪Blood stains the whole land red♪

270
00:14:02,910 --> 00:14:04,250
♪The bonds we forged stay in my heart♪

271
00:14:04,250 --> 00:14:05,560
♪Plots and schemes are everywhere♪

272
00:14:05,560 --> 00:14:06,820
♪Deceit runs deep, hard to see through♪

273
00:14:06,820 --> 00:14:08,220
♪Every step is planned. I won't retreat♪

274
00:14:08,220 --> 00:14:09,580
♪A spark ignites in the dark♪

275
00:14:09,580 --> 00:14:10,910
♪So what if fate mocks me?♪

276
00:14:10,910 --> 00:14:12,180
♪This fight will defy fate itself♪

277
00:14:12,180 --> 00:14:13,560
♪Break every shackle, break every lock♪

278
00:14:13,560 --> 00:14:16,560
♪Anger burns inside my chest♪

279
00:14:16,560 --> 00:14:18,870
♪No more fear, no more losing my way♪

280
00:14:18,870 --> 00:14:21,530
♪With blood and sweat, I forge my glory♪

281
00:14:22,180 --> 00:14:24,530
♪In this world of chaos,
I carve out a road to brighter days♪

282
00:14:24,530 --> 00:14:27,100
♪My legend, I'll write
every chapter myself♪

283
00:14:31,560 --> 00:14:34,130
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

284
00:14:34,130 --> 00:14:36,860
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

285
00:14:36,860 --> 00:14:39,140
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

286
00:14:39,140 --> 00:14:42,140
♪My fate is mine to command.
Who dares stand in my way?♪
